{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "86187f8875ef8f40deeace0fecf77996700fa1cb74c2a8310a8190343615f7c2", "ja": "（社長に、いきなり呼び出されたけど……、\n何の用だろう？　しかもここ、飲み屋だよな？）", "zh": "（突然被社长叫了出来……\n不知道有什么事情？而且这里不是酒馆吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1001_president", "source_sha256": "20882b04fa6ac2949ac9bb0cb7a70ecfe39f803ea7521062773445701df24f6d", "ja": "おお、君！　こっちだよ、こっち！\nよく来てくれたね！", "zh": "喔喔，你来啦！这边、这边！\n我就等着你过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "872817d19caf502a17cdb59e095f3088c01c5300436659aace6d7d25ab377832", "ja": "あら、キミが噂の{$P$}くん？\nこんばんは♪", "zh": "哎呀，你就是社长说的{$P$}？\n晚安♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a1e3ad3f9f53fd152612600f05eb2c7acf62a207bb32c2952e427d8b8c282e5c", "ja": "あ、はい。こんばんは。\n……えっと、社長？　こちらの女性は？", "zh": "啊，我就是。晚安。\n……不好意思，社长？请问这位小姐是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1004_president", "source_sha256": "089a35af085e5b5f478dfcf350ef25dbd6bced78bde3be1bfe3bfb1e830978f9", "ja": "素敵な女性だろう？\n彼女はね……", "zh": "她很漂亮对吧？\n她啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "051e2f8c40282b00c8cf371a9eeeeac1e65c15bd117f63f2a94425496f221ea1", "ja": "百瀬莉緒よ。よろしくね♪", "zh": "我叫做百濑莉绪，请多指教啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "b0d17d56118143ad7f047edd618986ab3ffa9c6e733a536850fa73d1f050a910", "ja": "社長とは、ここで意気投合して仲よくなったの。\nそうしたら……えっと、なんだったかしら？", "zh": "我和社长是在这里认识的，聊得很投机。\n然后就说到……我想想，那个叫什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "8191c7940ea94f72b5344f6da474f996ed6862e35ecd7fa1082f239de21fa12a", "ja": "さん……なんとかプロジェクトの、\nアイドルになってみないかって誘われたのよ。", "zh": "3……3什么PROJECT的，\n他问我要不要加入当偶像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "25d3b224d9abf0bffd4420fbd89c66dfab599c6c3979e8f75a0b7fe2eec184c1", "ja": "もしかして、39プロジェクト？", "zh": "你该不会是指39PROJECT？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "4fd56838a931679290bdbc7a4422c44abd4d81d17fc8b38e7652eadf1d60df11", "ja": "そう！　それ♪", "zh": "没错！就是那个♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1010_president", "source_sha256": "e9f2ad3ccac3ef1eb272ed5721aed8cc329a4a6ac31865560e46924649b07b85", "ja": "どうやら状況を把握したようだね。では百瀬君、\n詳しいことは、彼から直接聞いてくれるかな？", "zh": "看来你已经理解状况了。那么百濑，\n详情就麻烦你直接请教他吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1011_president", "source_sha256": "0adf82eae92022b9f233fa35b189f6d7f44659b82ce68e50f2edc28c441fd9df", "ja": "では、私は酔いを醒ましてくる！\n君！　後は頼んだよ！", "zh": "好啦，我要去醒醒酒！\n接下来就麻烦你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "39a74b93ef4ca02a433d7470a94cb08b732e8d0a214188e5a63428d1d78183e0", "ja": "えっ？\n社長、ちょっと……！？", "zh": "什么？\n社长，等等……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "ea54625c1d35ba4d8b3e433fd973034cb00dcf3fa4961e6017d781b183849dc5", "ja": "あら、ホントに帰っちゃったの？　あん、残念♪\nもうちょっとお喋りしたかったのにな～。", "zh": "哎呀，他真的回去啦？讨厌，真可惜♪\n我还想多聊几句的说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f932cf422b986e3513eaa9d4ab579d9527cdabe1b9447c04af32c6ce20e93cb9", "ja": "（俺はもうちょっと事情を聞きたかった……）", "zh": "（而我是还想把事情问得更清楚一点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f11d1399710484bd8fc6e27528f535ba4338a539e2ad86039d8e26fbd558999e", "ja": "（でもこの子……、社長の目に留まっただけあって、\nスタイル抜群だな）", "zh": "（不过这女生……也难怪社长会看上她，\n她的身材十分出众。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c79850b35cac16259c9b383f940e790aee5fd1887253b36439b5ec31ea5a4e45", "ja": "（華やかなタイプの美人だし、\nこれなら、アイドルとしてもきっと……）", "zh": "（是很艳丽的美女，\n这样要当偶像也肯定没问题……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "49b782952654246cdf5628d9727827f534b5b9364615c55a1d14a285971601bd", "ja": "ウフフ、な～に？　ジロジロ見ちゃって♪\n社長が帰った途端、男の子になるのね？", "zh": "呵呵，怎么啦～？一直盯着人家看♪\n社长一回去，就露出小男生的本性啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "221605c1010cd32ff2dd5c57ade8eb45ac060f7274a7aacb0141012c30fd15b2", "ja": "え？\nあ、いや、そういうワケでは……。", "zh": "咦？\n啊，不是，不是那样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "219e3e0d64e1b2270db39dc679b4bb0780a8f273cbbf3f2832098002cbef27c7", "ja": "私、スタイルにはちょっと自信があるのよ。\nセクシー路線とかどうかしら？", "zh": "我对自己的身材还挺有自信的哦。\n走性感路线你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "ae0d1a0f0b3cf54fc5e7aebd910d1a56fd90201ed98810ab71cddf63e169621a", "ja": "キミは、脚と胸だったらどっちが好き？\nやっぱり胸？", "zh": "腿和胸部，你喜欢哪个呢？\n我看应该是胸部吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "47b00a40e32510bd9fe80e89189d640b2bf41bb871274ba32709ddb42d6ecc5b", "ja": "あの、ここで胸を寄せるのはちょっと……。", "zh": "不好意思，在公共场所这样挤胸口不太好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "18bd23b1c1ec80e86e06d57db0218b40a89e41061160aae26d7d1de5b7b1c706", "ja": "……って、あら？　なんか引いてる？\nちょっとちょっと、どうしてよー！", "zh": "……咦？奇怪了？为什么你好像吓到啦？\n等一下等一下，为什么啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "65d558dca258c34ad03b0b5c9e23277d2e30109093a54cb2222fd98bf216052c", "ja": "（今のは、サービス精神が旺盛……\nと思うことにしよう。よし！）", "zh": "（她刚才的行为，就当作是……\n热心服务观众吧。好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_1024", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3c411a9cececa3fb7d9e483acd69bcaf6c92269d2ad8805d8e652eb943ed0a3c", "ja": "えっと、百瀬莉緒さん。改めて……\n39プロジェクトの、アイドルになってくれませんか？", "zh": "呃，百濑莉绪小姐。我现在正式询问……\n你愿意成为39PROJECT的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2001_046rio", "source_sha256": "6009094e5c1842ac45763d4880b38a95fc8b1bf40964bd03b402cd6b0342bbce", "ja": "ええ、いいわよ。\nキミに、プロデュースされてあげる……ウフッ♪", "zh": "好啊，我愿意。\n就允许你培育我吧……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "aec90ad64b9259a5c4d062c531959bfbcf4815099c3f877a09dfa7f83a0594ff", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nこれからよろしくお願いします、莉緒さん。", "zh": "非常谢谢你。\n以后还请多指教了，莉绪小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2003_046rio", "source_sha256": "47a7752ad533c8340a7a630730913fe6b17564a3f50a6df84c4e373931725739", "ja": "やだ、呼び捨てでいいわよ。それに、敬語もナシ！\n私、堅苦しいのは苦手なの。", "zh": "讨厌，直接叫我名字就行了啦，也不用毕恭毕敬的！\n我不喜欢这么拘束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c3874ed2db7ac8ccbbc6b3268cfb9e46cf9ca7be2031f151e312e6778ca5251d", "ja": "じゃあ……わかった。でも今更だけど、\n即決しちゃって大丈夫だったのか？　仕事とかは……。", "zh": "好吧……我知道了。可是，虽然你已经答应了，\n但这么快决定没问题吗？你现在还有其他工作吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2005_046rio", "source_sha256": "37b235a69c22cb73b294287f202c2102df68820a677a136c4892d104f9c61161", "ja": "いいのいいの！　ちょうど、辞めちゃったト・コ・ロ♪\nこういうコトもあるのね～。", "zh": "放心放心！我正好才刚、辞、职♪\n世上就是有这么巧的事唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2006_046rio", "source_sha256": "252b2bd5a4c077f539bfec0df4923814dfafbcc38c71e59537a05a9b23a90d19", "ja": "それに、アイドルの仕事って面白そうだし。\n男の子に夢を与えるなんて、ちょっとステキじゃない？", "zh": "而且，偶像这份工作好像也挺有趣的。\n带给男孩子梦想，不是挺棒的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2007_046rio", "source_sha256": "b1f836f6dc7001623f4a48476cd3acb4b795a7566a41737834e7e35c5af0cebf", "ja": "それより……。とりあえず飲み屋にいるんだし、\n乾杯しない？　これからの私達に、ね？", "zh": "先别说那么多了……既然我们人都在酒馆了，\n先干杯再说吧？敬将来的我们，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "7d08310513907ff6d7f8c52e4696b894dfd07934e3fb9913be7b8ecbf9cb35be", "ja": "よかった。\nそれじゃ……これからよろしく、莉緒！", "zh": "没问题就好。\n那么……以后请多指教了，莉绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_046rio_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_046rio_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "b92f3ee25149e5fb105e0668ae766f1f51d0b75e3d1e8a7d3ba88fae288492b9", "ja": "（ノリもいいし、この分なら仲よくやって\nいけそうかな。どんなアイドルになるか、楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（她很健谈，这样看来，我们应该可以相处得很好。\n真期待她会成为怎样的偶像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
